WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:36.160 --> 01:36.820
Dema!

02:07.060 --> 02:08.390
It's no use.

02:09.020 --> 02:11.010
That Dema does not have a soul.

02:11.330 --> 02:15.350
Absorbing its life energies
won't render it useless!

02:36.380 --> 02:37.540
Are you all right?

02:38.220 --> 02:39.120
Thanks...

02:39.450 --> 02:41.510
I think I'll excuse myself now.

02:57.340 --> 03:02.280
Our Fox Deity, Receives some Memories

03:03.010 --> 03:07.120
Boss, with the Byakki gone,
now is the time to do it.

03:07.120 --> 03:07.580
What?

03:08.180 --> 03:11.640
Only the "parent" of the Byakki
can become the lord of the oni.

03:12.090 --> 03:16.680
The only way one can become a new
"parent" is by killing the current one.

03:19.690 --> 03:20.660
Tomine...

03:23.570 --> 03:29.030
Chief, about the Sakasaen...
I don't think we'll need it.

03:30.040 --> 03:33.670
I'll begin my treatment of the Byakki.

03:34.040 --> 03:35.810
Is that all right?

03:36.180 --> 03:37.840
Do as you wish.

04:05.740 --> 04:06.800
It's the Kugen fox!

04:07.710 --> 04:09.230
Is it here to interfere again?

04:10.950 --> 04:12.810
You're the ones who are in the way.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.610
I want to see, too.

04:17.820 --> 04:20.010
Why is there a Dema here?!

04:20.720 --> 04:24.450
Where did you people obtain that Dema?!

04:25.330 --> 04:27.620
Boss and Tomine did...

04:32.570 --> 04:33.360
Shiro...

04:53.820 --> 04:55.290
Let go! Let me go!

04:55.290 --> 04:56.190
Toru?

05:01.100 --> 05:02.390
Please make your decision.

05:03.060 --> 05:07.060
You must become the "parent" of the
Byakki to become the lord of the oni.

05:07.440 --> 05:10.530
Our wishes can never be
fulfilled unless you do so.

05:12.210 --> 05:15.000
If you cannot do it, I will.

05:15.910 --> 05:17.210
No! Stop!

05:29.090 --> 05:29.780
Toru!

05:29.890 --> 05:30.880
Ku-chan!

05:33.330 --> 05:34.390
Shiro-chan is!

05:35.100 --> 05:35.990
I know.

06:22.080 --> 06:23.040
Ku-chan!

06:35.860 --> 06:38.690
I'll start the treatment.

06:50.810 --> 06:52.070
The Sakasaen!

07:00.250 --> 07:02.380
What were you trying to do?

07:03.650 --> 07:05.080
A medical treatment.

07:05.450 --> 07:08.850
Are you not trying to place a seal?

07:08.920 --> 07:12.830
To the Byakki, it's a medical treatment.

07:13.160 --> 07:14.090
I will not let you.

07:15.560 --> 07:17.360
Why's that?

07:17.870 --> 07:20.230
Because that is not what Toru-sama wants.

07:20.500 --> 07:24.770
Are you telling me you're going to interfere?

07:43.420 --> 07:45.130
What's going on here?

07:45.130 --> 07:45.890
Noboru!

07:47.090 --> 07:47.890
Toru!

07:52.230 --> 07:53.390
Who's this?

07:54.440 --> 07:55.490
It's Shiro-chan.

07:55.640 --> 07:56.700
No way!

07:56.700 --> 07:58.300
She looks a lot bigger!

08:00.370 --> 08:01.340
Toru...

08:03.110 --> 08:04.440
Toru...

08:18.190 --> 08:19.960
I can talk...

08:20.090 --> 08:21.190
Shiro-chan?

08:23.000 --> 08:24.000
How?

08:24.000 --> 08:26.360
I don't know either.

08:26.870 --> 08:32.930
But I always wanted to talk to you.

08:33.640 --> 08:37.300
That's why it makes me happy...

08:39.010 --> 08:40.670
Hello, Bekira?

08:41.020 --> 08:45.080
The shockwave from the explosion
turned on the vocal cords of the Byakki.

08:45.490 --> 08:47.450
It can now start casting its spells.

08:47.660 --> 08:51.390
If the spirits gather in its current state,
things will become hopeless for all of us.

08:52.890 --> 08:54.700
Bekira, can you hear me?

08:54.700 --> 08:59.690
Unfortunately, that witch doctor is a
bit busy dealing with our Mamorime.

09:01.200 --> 09:07.400
Let me guess. The Byakki can
summon spirits just by speaking.

09:07.610 --> 09:10.440
That could be a huge threat!

09:10.580 --> 09:13.950
So that's why the gods are so
insistent on killing the Byakki!

09:14.020 --> 09:18.320
The Byakki has weakened.
She's dying as we speak.

09:18.890 --> 09:20.620
Let me seal the Byakki.

09:20.760 --> 09:23.120
No. That will make Toru sad.

09:23.460 --> 09:26.290
Is the death of the Byakki what Toru-kun wants?

09:26.290 --> 09:28.890
He won't want her to be sealed either.

09:29.060 --> 09:33.100
You want to tell me he is the kind who
would rather see a girl die in front of him...

09:33.100 --> 09:35.830
...than go somewhere far away?!

09:36.340 --> 09:39.330
Why are the only choices
to kill her or to seal her?!

09:39.510 --> 09:42.140
Why isn't there the option to treat Shiro?

09:43.010 --> 09:48.040
As long as Toru-kun is the "parent" of the Byakki,
the oni clan will be after him!

09:48.120 --> 09:49.950
They'll continue to make attempts on his life!

09:50.380 --> 09:53.250
The oni clan will never stop seeking the Byakki.

09:55.420 --> 09:56.220
Is that right?

09:56.620 --> 09:57.520
Yes.

09:59.590 --> 10:00.720
Fine.

10:04.170 --> 10:05.330
Noboru, answer me!

10:05.330 --> 10:06.160
Noboru!

10:10.670 --> 10:11.500
Ku, is that you?

10:11.810 --> 10:12.600
There you are.

10:12.870 --> 10:15.770
There's something I want you
to do as quickly as possible.

10:16.840 --> 10:19.780
Stop the Mamorime. She should listen to you.

10:20.310 --> 10:22.870
Then take the woman in the white coat to Shiro.

10:23.180 --> 10:25.210
Let her seal Shiro.

10:26.120 --> 10:27.520
What does that mean?

10:27.890 --> 10:30.250
At this rate, Shiro will die.

10:31.030 --> 10:34.360
It's better for her to be sealed than to die.

10:34.730 --> 10:36.800
What?! You're going from
one extreme to the other!

10:36.800 --> 10:40.230
Besides, what would Toru say?

10:41.470 --> 10:42.490
Well...

10:43.200 --> 10:44.190
Let me talk to Toru.

10:45.140 --> 10:46.210
What are you going to say to him?

10:46.210 --> 10:48.140
Don't worry. Let me talk to him.

10:50.950 --> 10:51.780
Ku-chan?

10:51.780 --> 10:53.300
What's going on?

10:57.420 --> 10:58.180
Uh-huh.

11:09.830 --> 11:12.730
We have to help Shiro-chan...

11:12.970 --> 11:14.560
After how far she's come...

11:14.940 --> 11:17.340
You've really grown up...

11:17.940 --> 11:19.840
Ko! That's enough!

11:22.510 --> 11:24.570
Thanks for everything.

11:31.950 --> 11:37.020
The Byakki will not die.
She'll just go to sleep.

11:45.330 --> 11:51.760
Injecting this into her little by little will put
her into a state of suspended animation.

11:51.970 --> 11:53.530
Why do you keep it there?

11:53.910 --> 11:57.000
It has to be kept at body temperature.

11:57.140 --> 11:58.200
I see...

12:20.400 --> 12:21.230
Tomine.

12:22.040 --> 12:27.570
I heard from him that you were the traitor.

12:28.010 --> 12:31.840
Being by the side of one with
power brings me security.

12:32.010 --> 12:34.540
Because it allows me to root myself with it.

12:34.980 --> 12:36.710
And you are saying I don't have any power?

12:36.880 --> 12:38.910
The oni clan itself does not have power.

12:39.850 --> 12:42.760
I thought you did everything
for the sake of our clan.

12:43.560 --> 12:46.290
I used to.

12:47.430 --> 12:50.300
I still do even today.

12:51.170 --> 12:53.290
I will continue to do so as long as I live!

13:00.170 --> 13:01.140
Toru?

13:02.280 --> 13:05.110
I went home.

13:05.310 --> 13:07.250
Home? You mean my home?

13:07.250 --> 13:09.080
Yes, home.

13:09.550 --> 13:13.320
But the Sakasaen scared me.

13:13.890 --> 13:18.090
So I ran. I ran to the school.

13:18.830 --> 13:21.390
Because I thought you'd be there.

13:22.200 --> 13:25.690
I wanted to see you...

13:25.870 --> 13:32.270
Why would you run away
from Enju-san just to see me?

13:32.870 --> 13:36.570
Why?

13:36.910 --> 13:41.970
You said we'll be family.

13:42.250 --> 13:44.010
Don't you remember?

13:44.290 --> 13:46.080
I remember.

13:49.590 --> 13:50.820
I do remember.

13:55.000 --> 13:58.430
So I came home.

13:58.830 --> 14:02.960
I always thought you came
because I was the "parent."

14:03.340 --> 14:04.930
What's a "parent?"

14:05.270 --> 14:07.470
I don't know what that is.

14:11.210 --> 14:15.210
I'm your family.

14:15.920 --> 14:17.940
You told me that.

14:19.890 --> 14:21.050
I did.

14:26.890 --> 14:30.800
I feel sleepy.

15:21.080 --> 15:24.780
We will watch over the Byakki as best we can.

15:25.890 --> 15:27.350
Thank you.

15:44.170 --> 15:47.410
They say first loves never work out.

15:47.410 --> 15:49.310
It's not like that!

15:49.310 --> 15:50.870
Well, I don't think it is...

15:54.280 --> 15:57.050
Let's go home. I'll make some omelets with rice.

16:01.620 --> 16:05.320
I heard it was you who sold that golem to Enju!

16:05.930 --> 16:08.620
Where did you get it?! That thing is...

16:09.500 --> 16:12.900
Yes, only one being can create the Dema.

16:13.170 --> 16:17.260
You should know who I am by now.

16:17.640 --> 16:23.300
I managed to outsmart the Overseers but
couldn't erase the members of Mizuchi.

16:23.910 --> 16:25.900
The plan was a 70% failure.

16:26.250 --> 16:29.310
These oni are so useless.

16:29.550 --> 16:31.540
Why would your master do this?

16:31.750 --> 16:36.160
An ordinary familiar like me
would have no way of knowing.

16:36.420 --> 16:41.020
But I have asked the same question.

16:41.930 --> 16:45.560
The response I received was
that it was out of loneliness.

16:45.930 --> 16:48.960
I was also told it was out of happiness.

16:49.400 --> 16:53.240
Do you understand?
It was all done for your sake.

16:53.540 --> 16:55.030
Tenko Kugen.

17:14.800 --> 17:19.200
I heard you did the Spirit Passing for
the previous head of the Mizuchi family.

17:19.370 --> 17:20.260
Yes, I did.

17:20.670 --> 17:21.690
That's stupid.

17:22.800 --> 17:23.670
Why?

17:24.140 --> 17:26.300
I don't think so.

17:26.370 --> 17:27.500
Why aren't you mad?

17:27.910 --> 17:30.540
Whether I get mad or not is up to me.

17:31.150 --> 17:33.080
Why are you mad?

17:33.550 --> 17:38.850
Don't you know how long you were sealed?
You're insane to think nothing of it!

17:40.750 --> 17:42.280
Don't you hate us?

17:43.460 --> 17:44.390
Hate who?

17:44.630 --> 17:45.390
Humans.

17:46.890 --> 17:51.190
Humans are the ones keeping you in here.

17:51.670 --> 17:55.190
You were also at fault,
so I guess it can't be helped.

17:56.200 --> 17:58.430
But doesn't it make you mad?

17:58.840 --> 17:59.970
Not really.

18:00.540 --> 18:05.500
If you ever get out of here,
would you want to get revenge?

18:06.450 --> 18:07.540
Not really.

18:08.380 --> 18:09.540
Really?

18:10.080 --> 18:10.950
Yes.

18:16.590 --> 18:20.920
So that's what Miyako was worried about.

18:21.930 --> 18:22.760
But...

18:24.500 --> 18:28.490
I think I felt some hatred toward humans at first.

18:28.800 --> 18:32.470
But I've forgotten all about it now.

18:32.470 --> 18:34.000
That's impossible!

18:34.410 --> 18:38.540
I've forgotten the hatred and
memories of being humiliated.

18:38.710 --> 18:45.450
But that's because I didn't find
those emotions necessary.

18:47.860 --> 18:48.650
Then...

18:50.460 --> 18:53.150
But still...

18:53.430 --> 18:55.790
Why would you side with the humans?

18:56.200 --> 19:00.070
I still remember the fun memories.

19:00.070 --> 19:05.870
Those memories are necessary to me.

19:06.210 --> 19:12.740
I like how I remember good
things and forget about the bad.

19:16.380 --> 19:20.620
I still remember the hatred and humiliation.

19:22.760 --> 19:25.780
You weren't given any good memories.

19:26.560 --> 19:28.030
And you were?

19:29.100 --> 19:32.330
Yes. Even today, I receive them.

19:32.900 --> 19:35.960
That's not fair.

19:36.370 --> 19:43.170
Yes. That's why you don't
need to do anything for me.

19:59.090 --> 20:01.360
I'm already satisfied...

20:06.700 --> 20:08.530
Is Tama-chan your?

20:08.900 --> 20:10.000
My brethren.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.130
Brethren?

20:11.310 --> 20:14.570
That means we were born from the same mother.

20:17.280 --> 20:21.610
If Noboru was imprisoned for centuries...

20:22.620 --> 20:25.920
I think I would have gotten really mad, too.

20:29.490 --> 20:34.550
Ku-chan said she doesn't remember
the hatred or humiliation.

20:35.500 --> 20:39.300
But it looks like she remembers
the good memories.

20:42.900 --> 20:47.240
I wonder if Shiro-chan will
remember the good memories.

20:47.670 --> 20:49.700
That would be nice.

20:59.150 --> 21:05.610
Sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:06.090 --> 21:13.300
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:14.670 --> 21:21.160
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

21:21.310 --> 21:28.940
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

21:29.850 --> 21:36.880
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

21:37.490 --> 21:43.990
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

21:44.200 --> 21:51.640
Daijoubu bokura ha hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

21:51.640 --> 21:59.250
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

21:59.250 --> 22:06.920
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:06.920 --> 22:18.160
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

22:28.680 --> 22:32.340
Do you remember the "shadow projection"
game we did when we were small?

22:32.650 --> 22:37.640
You stare at your shadow for 10 seconds without
blinking, and then quickly turn to the sky...

22:37.820 --> 22:40.120
You'll see your shadow in the sky.

22:40.350 --> 22:41.510
That's just an afterimage.

22:43.490 --> 22:44.790
That doesn't matter.

22:46.560 --> 22:50.860
Being able to enjoy it with
those close to us is all we need.

22:52.070 --> 22:54.190
Should I be allowed to have fun?

22:54.570 --> 22:55.500
Of course.

23:01.040 --> 23:06.500
Even if it's just an afterimage,
we have to give it our all, Shimenogi.

23:06.880 --> 23:07.510
Of course!

23:07.850 --> 23:09.480
Gather everyone here.

23:09.720 --> 23:12.180
We'll start by mastering the "shadow projection."

23:13.190 --> 23:20.820
We will create the greatest shadow in
the world and project it onto the sky!

23:24.900 --> 23:25.270
Next Time

23:25.270 --> 23:27.170
Next Time
A Binbogami came to our city.

23:27.170 --> 23:30.400
Next Time
I have to capture him before he
possesses any of the people here.

23:30.400 --> 23:33.740
Next Time
As the god of this land!
As the owner of this convenience store!

23:33.740 --> 23:33.910
Next Time

23:33.910 --> 23:35.110
Next Time
Next time, "Our Fox Deity,
Bakes Some Sweet Potatoes."

23:35.110 --> 23:36.080
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Bakes Some Sweet Potatoes
Next time, "Our Fox Deity,
Bakes Some Sweet Potatoes."

23:36.080 --> 23:36.210
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Bakes Some Sweet Potatoes

23:36.210 --> 23:39.150
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Bakes Some Sweet Potatoes
If you see a Binbogami, do
not let him inside your home.

23:39.150 --> 23:39.840
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Bakes Some Sweet Potatoes
